1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,997
Associated Press reports that southern Europe is fighting severe wildfires during intense heat and strong winds.

2
00:00:08,947 --> 00:00:16,755
Three firefighters have died in Greece, while France is battling a huge blaze in the Gironde region.

3
00:00:16,755 --> 00:00:19,535
Thousands of people have been evacuated.

4
00:00:19,535 --> 00:00:27,873
Scientists warn that climate change is making European fire seasons hotter, longer and harder to control.

